  "sourceTitle": "Qwen3.8-27B: Using KV Cache Transplants to Boost Output Quality",
  "sourceBodyHash": "af7809205ec1ac3d299d3e8046010909ecdae7396d2621bb06c71ce04cef43b3",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-26T06:55:28.857144Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T12:43:06.497791Z",
  "totalBlocks": 61,
  "translatedBlocks": 61,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33b51b0c3627e1a6",
      "translationZh": "自从我上一篇博客以来，我一直在考虑动态性能降级的不同选项，试图从我的 GPU 中榨取出尽可能高质量的推理。",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ac7576843ad520c",
      "translationZh": "周末我读了一篇非常有趣的论文：《Cache-to-Cache: Direct Semantic Communication Between Large Language Models》。在文中，作者描述了运行多大模型智能体系统的过程。但他们没有让智能体通过“框架+工具调用+消息”的方式相互交流，而是通过将一个智能体的 kvcache 直接融合成另一个智能体的上下文，来让它们传递上下文。",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6a9b1128e8a03f3",
      "translationZh": "假设这是可能的，你可以想象这是一种在智能体之间传递上下文的更快、更完整的方式：与其实让一个智能体生成摘要或交接消息，不如字面意思上直接提取其工作记忆并将其嫁接到目标模型上。",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53a3e4dab266604f",
      "translationZh": "他们接着描述了他们是如何做到这一点的，简单来说就是他们训练了一个小型神经网络，使其能够“转换”源模型和目标模型内部表示之间的格式，从而能够融合不同大小甚至不同架构模型的 kvcache。",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0cbab10c6f8e7b6f",
      "translationZh": "这让我开始思考：如果我想在同一模型的不同量化版本之间重用 kvcache 会怎么样？我的意思是，相同的架构、相同的训练过程……它们难道不应该是兼容的吗，甚至不需要训练一个“转换器”？",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a309004072e980f",
      "translationZh": "如果我以高精度量化开始推理，然后在设备空间不足时换入低精度量化来“接管”，会发生什么？与从一开始就运行低精度量化相比，我能获得更好的结果吗？",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c7ecec2ab9219d7",
      "translationZh": "剧透一下，所有这些问题的答案都是肯定的（在我运行的基准测试中）！我在下面详细介绍了所做具体实验。",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5bfabf3912dbed80",
      "translationZh": "我生成了不同上下文长度的困难 NIAH 风格任务，并让 5 种不同的 Qwen3.8 量化策略展开了较量！",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b343f12d6958563b",
      "translationZh": "对于这些任务，我使用了由 unsloth 制作的 Qwen3.8-27B 的三种不同量化版本：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e4576f3df257709",
      "translationZh": "基于这些量化版本，我定义了三种静态量化策略来运行任务：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "15c4458fd0364fe0",
      "translationZh": "IQ3_S：f16 kvcache，最大上下文 196,096",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8c23e901efd8e27f",
      "translationZh": "Q4_K_XL：q8_0 kvcache，最大上下文 183,296",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cce65a96c5d5038f",
      "translationZh": "Q6_K，f16 kvcache，最大上下文 175,104",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c088f175ad003d79",
      "translationZh": "请注意，Q3 和 Q4 策略的上下文窗口大小是针对 24 GiB GPU 设定的，而 Q6_K 案例需要超过 24 GiB 才能运行。这是为了评估在小设备上使用的静态量化策略与在大设备上使用的静态量化策略相比，性能差距有多大。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "779bd22173960e45",
      "translationZh": "其想法是看看动态量化策略能否弥补其中一部分差距！",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69c5d4939486f1e1",
      "translationZh": "说到这个，我定义了两个动态量化策略，分别与每个低精度静态模型案例进行比较。这些动态量化策略的上下文限制也都是针对 24 GiB GPU 设定的。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "41fbd01df7494aaf",
      "translationZh": "对于此策略，我针对一个多量化策略运行了任务，其最坏情况下的模型量化为 IQ3_S：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e7bd8fbf17d5eac5",
      "translationZh": "使用 Q6_K、f16 kvcache、最大上下文 54,272 启动任务",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5743e9b4d4441cf1",
      "translationZh": "然后换入 Q4_K_XL、f16 kvcache、最大上下文 109,312",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7ca37fb75c1dcb3a",
      "translationZh": "然后换入 IQ3_S、f16 kvcache、最大上下文 192,096",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20cf789645c068b0",
      "translationZh": "在数据中，你可以看到该策略被标记为 Q6→Q4→Q3，f16 KV。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b2d0b9bd3033ec5",
      "translationZh": "Q4_K_XL，q8_0 kv 对比",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "82a0652f6a161401",
      "translationZh": "对于此策略，我针对一种多量化策略运行了任务，其最坏情况量化为 Q4_K_XL，q8_0 kv：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "82d8921f2e9fd2dd",
      "translationZh": "然后将模型的 kvcache 量化为 q8_0。最大上下文：91,136",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9548dc66a67a2f2b",
      "translationZh": "然后将模型的 kvcache 量化为 q8_0。最大上下文：183,296",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd82dd3f2d3bae74",
      "translationZh": "（对于运行中的量化，我使用了上一篇文章中描述的热重载方法。f16<->q8_0 的转换由同一个 llama.cpp 分支处理。）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ff56fc9fbd497a2",
      "translationZh": "在数据中，你可以看到这种策略被标记为 Q6/f16→Q6/q8→Q4/f16→Q4/q8。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "54835981ab734625",
      "translationZh": "我生成了数十个独特的 NIAH（“大海捞针”）任务，这些任务指导模型解析大量输入文本，并遵循散布在文本中的特定指令以检索秘密值。（感谢 gkamradt/needle-in-a-haystack 提供部分源材料）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7312699a7255d029",
      "translationZh": "我选择了 NIAH，因为它似乎是评估多量化策略连贯性的合理方式。每个任务都要求模型对隐藏在干扰文本中的一系列“步骤”进行推理，因此，拥有移植 kvcache 的模型必须能够精确地从源模型停止的地方继续其思维过程。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09d32f01d925964e",
      "translationZh": "此外，NIAH 不需要复杂的测试设置，且答案在客观上是正确或错误的。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3370acf13ed2d308",
      "translationZh": "对于每个任务和测试用例，我测量了以下内容：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d0fcad5ca7f25a80",
      "translationZh": "结果（正确/错误）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b773c273557f059e",
      "translationZh": "生成的总令牌数",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c0fd4ef6d05b6b4",
      "translationZh": "尽管每种量化方式的预填充/解码速度都非常相似，但我仍然包含了耗时数据，因为我想证明多量化方法并不会比运行单量化策略明显更慢。在一种量化方式与另一种量化方式之间传输 kvcache 意味着我们无需重复预填充！",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4da0075f299b9e70",
      "translationZh": "总体而言，我列出的基准测试任务代表了 180 次不同的运行，我的 GPU 花了 14 小时 26 分钟才完成。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ba3f609686677ae",
      "translationZh": "这里最大的问题在于 IQ3_S/f16 策略。特别是在较重的任务中，它持续生成超过 5 万个推理令牌，并且经常在其上下文窗口（约 196k）完全用尽之前就无法生成任何响应。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0aa9e851b9fdaf4a",
      "translationZh": "不过，它在较短的任务上表现还算不错，甚至在与 Q6/f16 的一致性方面，得分甚至高于 Q4_K_XL 和 q8_0。我想这要归功于 xhigh 推理能力吧！",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ffd73c2a683aafa",
      "translationZh": "说到与 Q6/f16 的一致性，对我来说这是一个重要的跟踪指标，因为我想比较动态方法在多大程度上更接近高精度参考值。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fda4889afce78dd3",
      "translationZh": "这张图表显示了最终答案与 Q6/f16 结果完全相同的任务数量，即使该答案是错误的。这里的动机是确定动态量化策略是否能近似 Q6/f16，我认为这张图表是一个强有力的指标，表明它是可以的！",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de82877c0657940d",
      "translationZh": "在这两种情况下，动态量化模型的结果都比其静态对应模型更接近 Q6/f16 模型的结果。总体而言，避免使用 IQ3_S 的路径在高上下文长度下更接近 Q6，这并不令人意外！",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9cd81921b9db59e4",
      "translationZh": "我不想过分强调任务正确性，因此这里的重点在于“与 Q6/f16 的一致性”。这是因为我不确定我的 NIAH 任务是否具有广泛的代表性。（话虽如此，我仍在下方列出了任务正确性结果，供好奇的读者参考）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53866968aee106ad",
      "translationZh": "平均推理时间和平均输出令牌数",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7532457d2daa479",
      "translationZh": "这些图表展示了已完成任务种子的推理时间（秒）和总输出令牌数的算术平均值，包括不正确和上下文耗尽的运行结果。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53f1a730e4931bb3",
      "translationZh": "我特别想强调推理时间，因为对于动态策略而言，它包含了交换模型权重和量化 kvcache 的时间！",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69b26b80a18d4746",
      "translationZh": "我认为这很好地展示了此处的优势——跨任务的推理时间并不会因为采用了复杂的动态量化策略而变差。这是因为：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d94ef6d303cd98b3",
      "translationZh": "在交换模型权重（例如 Q6->Q4）时，我们执行的是直接的 KV 缓存移植，即直接将 kvcache 从一个量化级别移动到另一个量化级别。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e57cee6a59eeb332",
      "translationZh": "在量化现有模型的 kvcache（例如 Q6/f16->Q6/q8）时，我使用的是我 fork 的 llama.cpp，它可以热重载实时模型的上下文/运行时，并自动在 kvcache 精度之间进行转换。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e67e2b46837d371c",
      "translationZh": "简而言之，在这两种情况下，都不需要重复 prefill！转换后，模型将从中断处精确地继续 prefill/decode。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e15fe4b5e80d99c2",
      "translationZh": "以下是所有策略/运行中任务正确性的表格。我按“使用的最低模型精度”对结果进行了拆分，以便更容易进行静态与动态的对比。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d8ed36ef3dac706",
      "translationZh": "策略 10k 25k 50k 75k",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ddf2cc51c98f3ae",
      "translationZh": "结果：动态量化在 2 个案例中优于静态量化，1 次持平，1 次落后。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52fdcdee407091e3",
      "translationZh": "最坏情况 Q4_K_XL，q8 kv：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c3f4eeec7b1e317",
      "translationZh": "结果：在超过 50k 上下文时，动态量化优于静态量化，而在该阈值之前两者基本持平。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "755579e7cb108c35",
      "translationZh": "在这里，我将动态策略直接与基准进行比较，并移除了 10k 和 25k 的任务，因为在这些水平以下，动态策略实际上只是在运行 Q6/f16。它们每次都是完全相同的。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4211a779a737f1ea",
      "translationZh": "结果：我认为这些结果没有什么特别的意义，除了 IQ3_S 量化在长上下文时确实会崩溃。这张表说明了为什么我没有过于看重任务正确性。如果从字面上理解，它表明在 50-75k 上下文之间，Q6->Q4 和 Q6->Q6/q8 优于 Q6/f16！",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6af2b937bee24b2e",
      "translationZh": "总的来说，我对这些结果非常满意！",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dad3e0100550b4f1",
      "translationZh": "尽管这个基准测试并不完美，但就我的目的而言，我非常满意动态模型量化是抵消硬件限制所带来的典型精度损失的一种好方法。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f5abaf1c2808d9c",
      "translationZh": "我的测试主要围绕挑战 24 GiB GPU 的极限展开，因为这更容易与只能在 32 GiB GPU 上运行的基准进行比较。作为下一步，我打算将其集成到我的推理设置中，看看在开启所有高级功能（即投机采样和 mmproj，这两者在这些基准测试期间都没有启用）时表现如何。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8602a34382641722",
      "translationZh": "我的直觉告诉我，在实际推理中使用这些策略时，需要权衡好的一点是避免过于频繁地降低模型量化等级。虽然我认为连贯性应该没问题，但在某种程度上，更换权重所需的时间会变得明显。因此，我想尝试进行如下设置：创建大型的上下文“分段”，使模型在约 40-50k 个 token 内保持不变运行。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e44c25f9b8659453",
      "translationZh": "在我看来，Q6/f16->Q6/q8->Q4/f16->Q4/q8 策略已经是一个很好的例子。至少在我目前的 llama.cpp 修改中，kvcache 重载所需的时间比模型重载要短得多。也许我将来可以针对这一点进行优化！",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "264d670d5f4b649c",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/wadeAlexC 提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
  ],
